flowchart TD
  start([Someone opens a diagram]) --> signedIn{Signed in?}
  signedIn -->|No| signIn[/Sent to sign-in/]
  signedIn -->|Yes| exists{Diagram exists and not in the bin?}
  exists -->|No| notFound[/Not found/]
  exists -->|Yes| draft{Someone else's unsaved AI draft?}
  draft -->|Yes| notFound
  draft -->|No| base[Start at View: everyone signed in can read]
  base --> project{Access through the project or a parent?}
  project -->|Owner or admin| manage[Manage]
  project -->|Shared| grant[The share's level, to them or their Entra group]
  project -->|Neither| keep[View]
  manage --> share{Shared on the diagram, to them or their group?}
  grant --> share
  keep --> share
  share -->|Yes| diagramShare[The share's level, at most Edit]
  share -->|No| owner{Owns the diagram?}
  diagramShare --> owner
  owner -->|Yes| ownerManage[Manage]
  owner -->|No| highest[Take the highest level found]
  ownerManage --> highest
  highest --> viewer{Role is viewer?}
  viewer -->|Yes| cap[Capped at Comment]
  viewer -->|No| level([View, Comment, Edit or Manage])
  cap --> level
